No upstream source file is copied verbatim. The skill text, scripts, tests and
verification harness in this repository were written for ZCode. Shared ideas:
the plan/verify/review/ship workflow split, the "proof over claims" verification
stance, and the feature-map plus recipe structure used by the verifier.
